  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b287bc50cecb2576",
      "translationZh": "前不久，我发了一篇关于 embedflow 的文章",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "871f494e5f428145",
      "translationZh": "它引起了很多关注。基本思路很简单",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb6b3a832672f2f0",
      "translationZh": "保留现有的嵌入索引用于候选检索 → 用新的嵌入模型对 \"k\" 个候选项重新排序 → 逐步将新的嵌入物化，而不是必须先完成全部数据的重新嵌入才能使用新模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34c19e2e2818c84d",
      "translationZh": "这个项目受到的关注远超我的预期，许多评论都在问类似的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e52645cd7668326",
      "translationZh": "-想法不错，但我到底怎么知道该用多大的 K？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a8a99aa72c99151",
      "translationZh": "-缓存为空时会发生什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "278ae35594c1bde4",
      "translationZh": "-如何在生产流量上安全地测试这个方案？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80be43215a0ff03f",
      "translationZh": "-这个方案能与我的向量数据库配合使用吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "877c96c622f52cf0",
      "translationZh": "所以，过去一周我一直在把它从一个迁移引擎改造成真正能够支持实际迁移工作流的工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef27bfda5d8ec514",
      "translationZh": "1)支持 FAISS、Qdrant、pgvector、Pinecone、Milvus 和 Weaviate。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5dda2de5dd50da38",
      "translationZh": "迁移规划器 -> embedflow plan 会查看源索引、源模型/目标模型契约、探测查询以及其他证据，并推荐一个候选 K 值和迁移计划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "242d6b43c876169e",
      "translationZh": "3)影子模式 -> 你可以让新的嵌入路径处理真实流量，同时仍以旧的/源检索结果为准。影子路径即使崩溃、超时或达到饱和，也不会改变或阻塞用户收到的响应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7276d07bc4676337",
      "translationZh": "4)流量感知预热 5) 持久化目标缓存 + 后台物化 6) 详尽的报告",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3048a6ce0ad6750",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 python 中使用它，只需",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
